┃ Hi Robin,                                                                                                                                                                                            ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                                                                      ┃
┃ Here is the draft roadmap for Q4. The short version: we ship the sync rewrite in October, spend November on search, and keep December for whatever the first two months break.                       ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                                                                      ┃
┃ Three things I would like your eyes on before Thursday:                                                                                                                                              ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                                                                      ┃
┃ 1. The search milestone assumes the index format is settled. Is it?                                                                                                                                  ┃
┃ 2. I have pencilled in two weeks for the offline queue. Tell me if that is fantasy.                                                                                                                  ┃
┃ 3. The on-call rota over the holidays is still empty.                                                                                                                                                ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                                                                      ┃
┃ The PDF has the detail, including the dependency chart you asked for. Comments in the doc or by reply, whichever is easier.                                                                          ┃
┃                                                                                                                                                                                                      ┃
